  id: ingrid
  displayName: Ingrid
  description: A wandering herb-woman who got lost in the mist while hunting for rare roots. She knows more about the curse than she lets on.
  rescueLine: Thank the old gods! I've hidden from the wolves for days. Get me out of here and I'll follow you anywhere.
  arrivalLine: A real home, under a living tree... I could be useful here. I know a thing or two about cursed things.
  fallenLine: I can't... go on. I'll hide here. Come back for me.
